  "title": "David C NDE",
  "date": "2025-03-31T16:20:48.000Z",
  "content": "On July 2, 2021, I was at my home in my yard and walking towards the front door to my home. I tripped on a tree root. I do not remember the actual fall or even how I landed on the ground. <br><br> The next thing I remember was being in space. The night sky was completely full of bright stars as far as the eye could see. I do not know how I was standing or supporting myself but I do remember walking, as if I were on a solid foundation. As I was walking, I clearly remember asking, 'So, is this the way that everything ends?' At that point, a bank of twelve to fourteen stars appeared before me. One of the stars was yellow in color while all the others were white. The group of stars seemed to look me over, which did not take long.<br><br> The next thing I knew, was that I was on the ground in front of my home. I tried to get up but both my hands appeared to be three to four times their normal size as if they had been inflated like a balloon. This lasted for a period of time, at least minutes until I could finally drag myself to the staircase and grab the railing to lift myself up. <br> <br><span class=\"m108",
